  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YEM025N Yemen Joint Response 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will deliver an integrated suite of activities to support the vulnerable household across Yemen to meet their Food Security, Livelihoods, WASH and Health needs across the governorates of Sa&#x2019;ada, Hajjah, Lahj, and Aden. In addition to this, the project will focus on the Grand Bargain commitment of working with local actors and innovation and learning. Part of the localization a Framework for Capacity Assessment/ Building will be developed. For innovation JR will building on the existing Renewable Energy Alternatives-project, also a pilot project on livelihoods and WASH will be undertaken. Furthermore, a Learning Conference will be part of this JR, to further focus on the lessons learned. The project will provide assistance to at least 152.038 people across all four governorates.</narrative>
  </description>
